From dffc7fe67c7b2d8af7a410431d621dc0de0279be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 23:53:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] build(xtask): quick plan selects the shipped-example suites

A change in assets/posts/, assets/machines/, examples/, crates/post/src/
or crates/motion/src/ now adds the app suites that post or compare the
shipped examples (example_catalog*, first_part_programs and five more)
to the quick plan. PR #3478 and PR #3464 passed review without them.

Refs #3557
Refs #3572
Fixes #3521

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
